SUMMARY:Your Happiness Matter: Developing Compassion\, A Half-Day Retreat
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\nYour 
 Happiness Matter: Developing Compassion\, A Half-Day Retreat with Modern B
 uddhism Teacher Kadam Sharon Lovich\n\nOur normal viewing believing that s
 omehow we are more important than others has no basis in reality. This vie
 w causes us so many problems. Through engaging in a special meditation on 
 cherishing all living beings we can come to see the deceptive nature of th
 is view and from this begin to establish a basis for developing universal 
 compassion. Everybody welcome. Includes guided meditations\, talks and ref
 reshments after the retreat.\nCost: $30 (discounts and online options for 
 members)\n[Read More and Register](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/y
 our-happiness-matter-developing-compassion-half-day-retreat/)\n[Become a M
 ember](https://www.meditationinasheville.org/become-a-member/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31675287
 4/
