DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261107T130000
SUMMARY:Beads\, Mantras & Deities\, Mala-Making Workshop
DESCRIPTION:Meditation in Asheville: Meditation and Modern Buddhism\n**Man
 tra means ‘mind protection”.**\n*\\~Tantric Grounds and Paths\, Geshe 
 Kelsang Gyatso*\n\nMaking a mala\, or rosary of prayer beads is more than 
 just an arts & crafts project. If done mindfully\, it is a spiritual pract
 ice in itself\, and the object we create is also special\, becoming more a
 nd more blessed as we use it.\nMantra recitation is an essential element o
 f many spiritual practices\, as a way of requesting protection\, blessings
 \, and attainments. Learn how to make your own mala\, as well as some simp
 le mantras to connect with enlightened beings such as Buddha Shakyamuni\, 
 Avalokiteshvara\, and Tara.\nIncludes all materials.\nCost $35
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/meditationinasheville/events/31669737
 4/
